  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender in agriculture</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender in agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to persistent gender inequalities in farming, despite decades of development assistance, Sida initiated this evaluation. The purpose is to increase understanding of how Sida&#x2019;s development assistance in agriculture should be designed and implemented to ensure that women farmers are reached, that their needs as producers are met, and that it has a positive impact of their livelihood.</narrative>
  </description>
